{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261022/photo/bkn-20261022172316289-1022_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261022172316\"/><p>事主送院後回復意識。</p><p>今午(22日)3時46分，將軍澳坑口道一院舍的職員報案，指一名姓黎(18歲)男院友在院舍一房間內懷疑暈倒。事主昏迷被送往將軍澳醫院治理，其後恢復清醒，其暈倒原因有待調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T09:42:33.800576+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T09:23:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T12:46:47.127209+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T09:37:50.122215+00:00","content_hash":"3715d4eb30af7458116baa7c04fd5051db19e974240d5675a4369ad03e0eb3ac","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}